{
  "schema": "gnox-wizard/v1",
  "plugin": "update-readme-images",
  "title": "update-readme-images — Interactive Style Guide & Rules Design Mode",
  "description": "Configure project-specific README/SKILL visual style guides, glob-matched panel placement rules, OG social card sizing, and non-destructive draft staging (Charmbracelet huh/gum compatible).",
  "doctor_checks": [
    {
      "id": "project-readme-images-config",
      "type": "any_file_exists",
      "candidates": [
        ".gnox/readme-images.json",
        ".claude/readme-images.json",
        "config/readme-images.json",
        "readme-images.json",
        "plugins/update-readme-images/config/readme-images.json"
      ],
      "warn_when_external_fallback": true
    }
  ],
  "groups": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Project Visual Identity & Placement Setup",
      "fields": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "title": "Interactive Design Mode (update-readme-images)",
          "description": "This non-LLM wizard authors project-specific style guide, placement rules, and readme-images.json assets so update-readme-images uses your project's own visual identity rather than falling back to GNOMATIX OSS Skills defaults."
        },
        {
          "type": "input",
          "key": "workspace_root",
          "title": "GNOX workspace root namespace identifier",
          "default": "{{repo_name}}",
          "placeholder": "my-project",
          "validate": {
            "required": true,
            "regex": "^[a-zA-Z0-9._-]+$",
            "message": "Workspace root must contain only letters, digits, dots, underscores, or hyphens."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "select",
          "key": "config_location",
          "title": "Where should the project readme-images.json configuration live?",
          "default": ".gnox/readme-images.json",
          "options": [
            { "label": ".gnox/readme-images.json (Recommended cross-CLI project config)", "value": ".gnox/readme-images.json" },
            { "label": ".claude/readme-images.json (Claude Code project config)", "value": ".claude/readme-images.json" },
            { "label": "config/readme-images.json (Repository config/ folder)", "value": "config/readme-images.json" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "visual_style",
      "title": "Visual Style Language",
      "fields": [
        {
          "type": "select",
          "key": "art_direction",
          "title": "Primary illustration / visual style direction",
          "default": "saturday-morning-skottie-natural",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Saturday-morning 2D cel × dynamic comic ink (natural human complexions)",
              "value": "saturday-morning-skottie-natural"
            },
            {
              "label": "Clean architectural & technical isometric diagram illustration",
              "value": "technical-isometric"
            },
            {
              "label": "Editorial woodcut / vintage printshop engraving",
              "value": "editorial-engraving"
            },
            {
              "label": "Custom prose art direction",
              "value": "custom"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "key": "custom_art_direction",
          "title": "Describe your custom illustration & character style rules",
          "default": "Clean black ink linework, saturated daylight palette, realistic human complexions, diegetic in-scene title signage.",
          "when": {
            "field": "art_direction",
            "equals": "custom"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "input",
          "key": "primary_palette",
          "title": "Primary hex color palette (comma-separated)",
          "default": "#0B1F4A, #D62828, #FFFFFF, #003F88, #D4AF37"
        },
        {
          "type": "input",
          "key": "in_scene_typography",
          "title": "Diegetic in-scene title lettering guidance",
          "default": "Render titles natively inside scene signage with generous top headroom; never obscure faces or heads."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "placement_and_og",
      "title": "Panel Placement Rules & Social Previews",
      "fields": [
        {
          "type": "confirm",
          "key": "enable_section_subpanels",
          "title": "Include 16:9 section sub-panels under categorized README headings?",
          "default": true
        },
        {
          "type": "confirm",
          "key": "enable_og_social",
          "title": "Automatically build 1280x640 (<1 MB) Open Graph social preview images?",
          "default": true
        },
        {
          "type": "confirm",
          "key": "protect_existing_assets",
          "title": "Stage revisions for existing images into assets/drafts/ for approval instead of overwriting?",
          "default": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "outputs": [
    {
      "path": "{{config_location}}",
      "format": "json",
      "json_template": {
        "version": 1,
        "workspace_root": "{{workspace_root}}",
        "default_assets_dir": "assets/images",
        "draft_assets_dir": "assets/drafts",
        "draft_revision_policy": {
          "protect_existing": true,
          "callout_target": "user"
        },
        "auto_og_social_image": {
          "enabled": true,
          "assets_subdir": "assets/images",
          "source_suffix": "-banner",
          "output_suffix": "-og-image.jpg",
          "width": 1280,
          "height": 640,
          "quality": 92,
          "max_bytes": 1048576,
          "gravity": "center"
        },
        "style_guides": {
          "{{workspace_root}}": {
            "doc": ".gnox/style-guides/{{workspace_root}}.md",
            "summary": "Project-specific visual style guide ({{art_direction}}) authored via gnox:local-config-wizard.",
            "inherit": true,
            "og_social_image": true,
            "reference_images": [],
            "typography": {
              "in_scene_titles": "{{in_scene_typography}}"
            }
          }
        },
        "rules": [
          {
            "id": "root-readme-top-panel",
            "description": "Root README.md top-level hero banner immediately after H1.",
            "glob": "README.md",
            "doc": ".gnox/rules/readme-panels.md",
            "panels": [
              {
                "id": "repo-hero-banner",
                "type": "top-level-panel",
                "required": true,
                "placement": "after-h1",
                "src_pattern": "assets/images/{repo}-banner.jpg",
                "alt_pattern": "{repo}",
                "embed_style": "markdown",
                "dimensions": {
                  "aspect_ratio": "16:9",
                  "width": 1376,
                  "height": 768,
                  "format": "JPEG"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "path": ".gnox/style-guides/{{workspace_root}}.md",
      "lines": [
        "# Style Guide — `{{workspace_root}}`",
        "",
        "- **Namespace**: `{{workspace_root}}`",
        "- **Art Direction Preset**: `{{art_direction}}`",
        "- **Primary Palette**: `{{primary_palette}}`",
        "",
        "## Visual Rules",
        "",
        "- {{custom_art_direction}}",
        "- **Typography & Headroom**: {{in_scene_typography}}",
        "- **Non-Destructive Draft Policy**: `{{protect_existing_assets}}`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": ".gnox/rules/readme-panels.md",
      "lines": [
        "# Placement Rules — `{{workspace_root}}`",
        "",
        "- **Root Hero Banner (`top-level-panel`)**: Placed immediately after `# <Title>` in `README.md` at `assets/images/{repo}-banner.jpg` (`1376x768` `16:9` JPEG).",
        "- **Section Sub-Panels Enabled**: `{{enable_section_subpanels}}`",
        "- **Automatic 1280x640 OG Social Cards Enabled**: `{{enable_og_social}}`",
        "- **Non-Destructive Draft Staging (`assets/drafts/`)**: `{{protect_existing_assets}}`"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
